                        {"name": "augmented_properties", "in": "body", "type": "json", "schema": "Dict[ObjectTypeApiName, List[PropertyApiName]]", "required": True, "help": "A map from object type API name to a list of property type API names. For each returned object, if the  object\u2019s object type is a key in the map, then we augment the response for that object type with the list  of properties specified in the value."},
